# Source cameras for the 4K/3x3 mosaic. One RTSP URL per line, row-major:
#   1 2 3
#   4 5 6
#   7 8 9
#
# Exactly 9 non-comment lines required. Use the "Medium" quality RTSP alias
# from UniFi Protect (Camera -> Settings -> RTSP) for each camera.
#
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1234
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1235
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1236
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1237
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1238
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1239
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123a
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123b
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123c
